    "type": "Figure",
    "diagnosis": "Fundic gland polyp in familial adenomatous polyposis",
    "title": "",
    "legend": "Characteristic dilated oxyntic glands without dysplasia are observed; although low-grade dysplasia is frequently seen, malignant transformation is exceedingly rare.",
    "source": "Lodewijk A.A. Brosens",
    "copyright": "",
    "tablehtml": "",
    "imageUrl": "https://tumourclassification.iarc.who.int/static/dzi/31/232/1559.jpg",
